                type: 'paragraph',
                text: "La Podrida is the Spanish/Latin American equivalent of Oh Hell!. Exact bidding: predict tricks. Key difference: if you cannot follow suit you must play a trump. 'Podrida' = putrid; spoiling others' contracts by giving too many or too few tricks. Argentina, Mexico variants.",
              },
